deposit to confirm a booking?","question":"Do you require a deposit to confirm a booking?","answer":"A deposit or valid card details may be required to confirm high-demand periods and event bookings. Our reservations team will confirm the exact terms when you book."},{"value":"Which rooms are available at the hotel?","question":"Which rooms are available at the hotel?","answer":"We offer the Studio Room (₦50,000 weekday / ₦40,000 weekend), Executive Deluxe (₦80,000 / ₦60,000), Suite (₦150,000 / ₦120,000) and Penthouse (₦150,000 / ₦120,000). All rates include complimentary breakfast."},{"value":"Is breakfast included in the room rate?","question":"Is breakfast included in the room rate?","answer":"Yes. Every room reservation includes a complimentary breakfast served in our restaurant. You can also order from our full menu 24/7 through room service."},{"value":"Do the rooms have WiFi and air conditioning?","question":"Do the rooms have WiFi and air conditioning?","answer":"Absolutely. All rooms feature free high-speed WiFi, air conditioning, smart TVs, premium bedding, en-suite bathrooms and daily housekeeping."}],"defaultOpen":"How do I book a room at The DEN in Abuja?"}]}]]}]
